      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS BOBBIE (4) turned in a modest effort most recently when seventh at Healesville over 300m behind Pristine (17.29) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Has never been out of the placings from four starts out of this box. Has ability and is a key runner. TWO TRUTHS (1) turned spotting a big start finishing eighth (22.79) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a win and two minor placings from three starts from this draw. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. PAW JELANI (2) hit the ground running and was prominent to the turn but faded out of it when 5th at Ballarat in Grade 5 company. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. SILENT KNIGHT (7) boasts a solid strike-rate over this trip.",
